<title>LIECHTENSTEIN: Hilti 8-month net profit 133 mln Sfr.</title>
<headline>Hilti 8-month net profit 133 mln Sfr.</headline>
<dateline>SCHAAN, Liechtenstein 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>January through end-August, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			133		 vs 135</p>
<p> Op profit			98		  vs 124</p>
<p> Sales			    1,416	     vs 1,339</p>
<p> Financial income	     48		  vs 29</p>
<p> Cash flow			221		 vs 215</p>
<p>NOTE - Construction equipment group Hilti AG said in a statement its operating profit fell because of price pressure from sluggish economies in major European markets.</p>
<p>It said another drain on profits was strategic investment in expanding new markets and logistics, but did not elaborate on the amount of those investments.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
